flowchart LR
  AdminUI["Application Admin Console"]
  PortalUI["Participant Portal"]

  EventAPI["開催API<br/>event-handler"]
  DeployFlow["配置ワークフロー<br/>DeployCreateStateMachine"]
  Worker["配置担当<br/>CfnDeploy / DescribeStack"]
  PortalAPI["参加者API<br/>participant-handler"]
  Dispatcher["独自競技の実行担当<br/>coordination-dispatcher-handler"]
  Plugin["問題同梱のプラグイン<br/>validateOp / applyOp / projectForTeam"]
  Scorer["定期採点・状態調整<br/>GenericScoring"]
  Timer["EventBridgeの定期実行"]
  Store["保存用Repository<br/>DynamoDB / 対応するTurso構成"]
  Runtime["競技用AWS環境"]

  AdminUI -->|"管理者JWT・開催API"| EventAPI
  EventAPI -->|"配置要求イベント"| DeployFlow
  DeployFlow --> Worker
  Worker -->|"対象権限でCloudFormation操作"| Runtime
  PortalUI -->|"チームキー"| PortalAPI
  PortalUI -->|"チームキー・独自競技の操作"| Dispatcher
  Dispatcher --> Plugin
  Timer --> Scorer
  Scorer -->|"稼働確認など"| Runtime
  Scorer -->|"coordinationのtickを委譲"| Dispatcher
  EventAPI --> Store
  DeployFlow -->|"直接またはStatusWriter経由"| Store
  PortalAPI --> Store
  Dispatcher --> Store
  Scorer --> Store
